Figures and reference data for the documentation site live in this directory.

It is kept in version control even while empty because .gitignore's blanket
*.csv / *.png excludes required an explicit re-inclusion for this path
(!docs_site/docs/assets/**); tests/test_docs_publication_scope.py asserts that
re-inclusion still holds, and that assertion is clearer when the directory it
protects actually exists.

MkDocs does not copy this file into the built site: mkdocs.yml's exclude_docs
drops dotfiles.
